// spec = ["§4.4", "§4.5", "§18.1"]
// fixes = 0

// S-290 (W5-23 U2), §4.4: one past the limit of `instance_depth_256_fine.onsa`. `T(k)` has depth `k -
// 1`, so `T(257)` has depth 256 = 256, and `Some(x)` in `f257` has the type `Option[T(257)]` of depth
// 257: E0422 at the line of the wrap and the call of `f258`, which are on one line.

